From 67cb95ce6acdd3d766ae6113c143e50c0e838331 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:28:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Reuse prepared signing per VM invocation and complete stack
 core

Review integration note (2026-10-14; newly recorded explanation):
Prepare signing commitments once per invocation, reuse them for repeated SIGHASH/CHECKSIG, cache mint count, enforce the 8192-byte element ceiling, and complete the compiler-used stack operations. Transaction-wide cache sharing and full block validation remain separate work.

---
